{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099330/extras/b58be01b8b431cf88a7093b965977b00.avif?t=1770322536\" width=1138 height=640 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of the same old shooters? We hear you. In Uniqkiller, you create heroes with distinct appearances, skills, and styles for PvP battles in urban environments! The controls are so simple, that even your grandma could play. But don\u2019t get us wrong \u2013 it\u2019s fast, intense, and packed with endless possibilities. Play on PC or mobile, build your own path, and watch your &quot;Seekers&quot; shine and reach the spotlights.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099330/extras/3b9a50726d06ce2a857e195fdd7a2fdc.avif?t=1770322536\" width=750 height=161 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead of settling for pre-made characters that need to be unlocked, you customize your operator by combining body type and parts, outfits, combat classes, skills and weapons to create a unique hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your gameplay and progression path. In Uniqkiller, your choices in creating and improving characters directly impact how you play and grow!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099330/extras/d02974ee54c3be6fed79dd40a8e2c557.poster.avif?t=1770322536\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099330/extras/d02974ee54c3be6fed79dd40a8e2c557.webm?t=1770322536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099330/extras/b6872902d66b0127f56c6b082615ac40.avif?t=1770322536\" width=750 height=161 /></span>With an auto-shooting system and simple, intuitive controls, Uniqkiller is easy to pick up and play. But the depth of customization for your operators, the variety of game modes, the top-down perspective, and tactical combat mechanics push the limits of strategic thinking \u2014 challenging players to truly stand out, whether you\u2019re a rookie or a pro.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099330/extras/04b4f0758009d4db7aaf485ab0968712.poster.avif?t=1770322536\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099330/extras/04b4f0758009d4db7aaf485ab0968712.webm?t=1770322536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099330/extras/04b4f0758009d4db7aaf485ab0968712.mp4?t=1770322536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099330/extras/d9e77178cf9996da8d067b77dd41fb51.avif?t=1770322536\" width=750 height=161 /></span>Uniqkiller is the first-ever Urban Shooter \u2014 where battles unfold across realistic cityscapes inspired by real-world locations. Gritty, modern, and unapologetically urban \u2014 no fantasy worlds here, just pure street attitude.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099330/extras/1682dea1007a58182a55506cf13ee985.poster.avif?t=1770322536\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099330/extras/1682dea1007a58182a55506cf13ee985.webm?t=1770322536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099330/extras/1682dea1007a58182a55506cf13ee985.mp4?t=1770322536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099330/extras/d7aa44082e9d76f15fabca8c80a41e1c.avif?t=1770322536\" width=750 height=161 /></span>Uniqkiller isn\u2019t just about playing. It\u2019s about being seen and making an impact. <strong>You start as a \u201cSeeker\u201d.</strong> The more you stand out in the game, the closer you get to becoming a \u201cUniqk\u201d \u2014 legendary players who\u2019ve left their mark so deeply that they\u2019ve been immortalized as collectible plushies, exclusive skins, in-game lore, and real-world rewards delivered right to your door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099330/extras/6e85f7e3dd3a60e1528190a8376c4097.avif?t=1770322536\" width=681 height=257 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099330/extras/1046de84f8e9c54ba5ebc2417c62f52e.avif?t=1770322536\" width=776 height=156 /></span>UniqKiller is a free to play cross platform and crossplay (PC and mobile), meaning that you can play whenever you are. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099330/extras/56ecd455ab27204de8e56104805aba43.avif?t=1770322536\" width=776 height=156 /></span>Play with or against your friends. Form alliances or start wars. It\u2019s all about standing out \u2014 solo or with your squad. Uniqkiller gives you all the tools to make your mark. To connect with other players and share your experience, join our Discord community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099330/extras/a03bfa130b01aa7cc302feff91ff136c.poster.avif?t=1770322536\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099330/extras/a03bfa130b01aa7cc302feff91ff136c.webm?t=1770322536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3099330?t=1770322536","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099330/2fbc6ed2ff748fd9b67e1d759f6b0302f56c5223/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770322536","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099330/84f0d18847cf323e38c953dded01541f255bbcbb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770322536","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099330/84f0d18847cf323e38c953dded01541f255bbcbb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770322536","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099330/extras/b58be01b8b431cf88a7093b965977b00.avif?t=1770322536\" width=1138 height=640 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of the same old shooters? We hear you. In Uniqkiller, you create heroes with distinct appearances, skills, and styles for PvP battles in urban environments! The controls are so simple, that even your grandma could play. But don\u2019t get us wrong \u2013 it\u2019s fast, intense, and packed with endless possibilities. Play on PC or mobile, build your own path, and watch your &quot;Seekers&quot; shine and reach the spotlights.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099330/extras/3b9a50726d06ce2a857e195fdd7a2fdc.avif?t=1770322536\" width=750 height=161 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead of settling for pre-made characters that need to be unlocked, you customize your operator by combining body type and parts, outfits, combat classes, skills and weapons to create a unique hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your gameplay and progression path. In Uniqkiller, your choices in creating and improving characters directly impact how you play and grow!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099330/extras/d02974ee54c3be6fed79dd40a8e2c557.poster.avif?t=1770322536\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099330/extras/d02974ee54c3be6fed79dd40a8e2c557.webm?t=1770322536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099330/extras/b6872902d66b0127f56c6b082615ac40.avif?t=1770322536\" width=750 height=161 /></span>With an auto-shooting system and simple, intuitive controls, Uniqkiller is easy to pick up and play. But the depth of customization for your operators, the variety of game modes, the top-down perspective, and tactical combat mechanics push the limits of strategic thinking \u2014 challenging players to truly stand out, whether you\u2019re a rookie or a pro.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099330/extras/04b4f0758009d4db7aaf485ab0968712.poster.avif?t=1770322536\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099330/extras/04b4f0758009d4db7aaf485ab0968712.webm?t=1770322536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099330/extras/04b4f0758009d4db7aaf485ab0968712.mp4?t=1770322536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099330/extras/d9e77178cf9996da8d067b77dd41fb51.avif?t=1770322536\" width=750 height=161 /></span>Uniqkiller is the first-ever Urban Shooter \u2014 where battles unfold across realistic cityscapes inspired by real-world locations. Gritty, modern, and unapologetically urban \u2014 no fantasy worlds here, just pure street attitude.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099330/extras/1682dea1007a58182a55506cf13ee985.poster.avif?t=1770322536\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099330/extras/1682dea1007a58182a55506cf13ee985.webm?t=1770322536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099330/extras/1682dea1007a58182a55506cf13ee985.mp4?t=1770322536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099330/extras/d7aa44082e9d76f15fabca8c80a41e1c.avif?t=1770322536\" width=750 height=161 /></span>Uniqkiller isn\u2019t just about playing. It\u2019s about being seen and making an impact. <strong>You start as a \u201cSeeker\u201d.</strong> The more you stand out in the game, the closer you get to becoming a \u201cUniqk\u201d \u2014 legendary players who\u2019ve left their mark so deeply that they\u2019ve been immortalized as collectible plushies, exclusive skins, in-game lore, and real-world rewards delivered right to your door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099330/extras/6e85f7e3dd3a60e1528190a8376c4097.avif?t=1770322536\" width=681 height=257 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099330/extras/1046de84f8e9c54ba5ebc2417c62f52e.avif?t=1770322536\" width=776 height=156 /></span>UniqKiller is a free to play cross platform and crossplay (PC and mobile), meaning that you can play whenever you are. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099330/extras/56ecd455ab27204de8e56104805aba43.avif?t=1770322536\" width=776 height=156 /></span>Play with or against your friends. Form alliances or start wars. It\u2019s all about standing out \u2014 solo or with your squad. Uniqkiller gives you all the tools to make your mark. To connect with other players and share your experience, join our Discord community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099330/extras/a03bfa130b01aa7cc302feff91ff136c.poster.avif?t=1770322536\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099330/extras/a03bfa130b01aa7cc302feff91ff136c.webm?t=1770322536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","developers":["HypeJoe Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099330/1008701ba8c5942fdad3d1da2f5b9d76211617d2/h